  },
  {
   "key": "script:0008:0236",
   "src": "dc7b2850148d",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Tranquilo-robo<NL>Ya cambiamos-robo<WAIT>¡Esta vez sí rozamos<NL>a un jefe-robo!"
